<http://data.silknow.org/object/9121614f-ba87-31a8-98bf-4115c68be2a9/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Ribbon of white woven silk. With a design commemorating the Coronation of George IV. The design consists of a rose, a shield with the words 'George IV Crown'd 1821', an orb surrounded by shamrock, a crown, a thistle and a circle in which is an eight-pointed star. Woven in satin on a silk ground and the ribbon has deckle edges. Wound on a wooden roller."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/9121614f-ba87-31a8-98bf-4115c68be2a9> .

